<title>UK: Bankers Trust sets 125 mln stg two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Bankers Trust sets 125 mln stg two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BT SECURITIES CORP</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    18.AUG.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     ZERO	PAY DATE    18.AUG.97</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  ISS PRICE  99.95     FULL FEES   0.10</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A	   REOFFER    99.95</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
